{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb1fe59501069d7d028cbbf876f16fa074810c5bfc9883b1fcd8ef67d8bee21d", "ja": "歌織さん、お疲れさまです。\n公演のブログ、読ませてもらいましたよ。", "zh": "歌织小姐，辛苦了。\n我看了公演的部落格啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "0753527ef750c5f60f2a5eac1d725284f2f87948386a84ae63532d355e9e9335", "ja": "あっ……そ、そうなんですね。あの……どうでしたか？\n私、内容がちょっと、大げさすぎたかもって……。", "zh": "啊……这、这样啊。那个……你觉得如何？\n我好像写得有点太夸张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "95fd0bcacb21e91b4b5d5d7efd5f09675fed4dd92fccdf40f67edfcbf60d27ec", "ja": "そんなことないと思いますよ。歌織さんの気持ちが\n伝わってきて、すごく良かったです。", "zh": "不会啊，可以感受到歌织小姐的心情，\n我觉得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "d97e2bdf96dec9a81b5e32478e72694836c102f23e8c8760a7240001162dae98", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかった……。\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……\n谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b342753e284c7ce0e94fd102644400a492f00d2e648690ce08b2800f62960f4d", "ja": "特に「歌いながら旅を続けていくことが、私の人生」\nっていうところとか……。", "zh": "尤其是「唱着歌旅行下去，就是我的人生」\n这一段……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "7a7b7bbce67587141f9d0878366de004e78d88ea42a246e23292fbf08a486f80", "ja": "あっ、いやっ！　やめてください……。\n読み上げるなんて、いじわるです……。", "zh": "啊，不要！别说了……\n竟然念出来，你好坏心眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "62be591b276905d62a9218ce57fabb84880340202bbded676da0159d3d965bf6", "ja": "す、すみません！\nからかうつもりはなかったんですが、つい！", "zh": "对、对不起！\n我没有要捉弄你的意思，不小心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b8ceed384be5483b5dde13a9aabe9641340e1a586f03cea45e5768c4bc2a43c", "ja": "もう……子供っぽいって、思われたんでしょう？\nでも、本当にそう思ったんです。", "zh": "真是的……你觉得我很孩子气吧？\n不过，我真的就是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "305474a3413bda9c4283a8004c4b92e13403237d5ff080d7cf129387c89932ac", "ja": "アイドルになる前も、なった後も……これからも。\n私は、歌いながら進んでいくんだろうなって。", "zh": "不论是当上偶像之前还是之后……以及今后……\n我应该都会继续唱着歌前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "717a673d829d70b05c04d2fb8e29240c1896ae1cd289a2fc50d9f146438bd3ed", "ja": "嬉しい時も、悲しい時も、\nたくさんの歌を、口ずさみながら……。", "zh": "不管是快乐还是悲伤，\n任何时候我都会哼着许多歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c547b183a18e6c955e54f2ebe0080d5995402e9c91a01350722850890c17d297", "ja": "そうですね。これからも、\n色々な歌を歌ってもらうことになると思いますよ。", "zh": "说得真好，那我今后也会让歌织小姐\n唱各式各样的歌喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "463e22a6b826eef79416376a525df6f08f26a6cb4ff50223386523a937b1d515", "ja": "はいっ、それはもう。{$P$}さんが\nくださる歌でしたら、よろこんで歌います♪", "zh": "好的！只要是{$P$}先生\n给我的歌曲，我都很乐意演唱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "d05082a99464718046b2a246923042fac18d3f9701ea1a24fa139ece7dd72b86", "ja": "……あのブログを書いている時も、思ったんです。\n歌が私の人生なら……。", "zh": "……在写那篇部落格的时候，我也有个想法，\n如果唱歌是我的人生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "81402d709e04479c1952930d3afbc24f75c946fc314d022fea3424959cdb479f", "ja": "歌をくださった{$P$}さんは、\n私に人生をくれた人……っていうことなのかな、って。", "zh": "那么给了我歌曲的{$P$}先生，\n就是给了我人生的人……可以这样说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "796c9947d398e5b11d9156e41a821b608618d81b7053af1278a5eb16f9b111a6", "ja": "えっ？　それは……。\nそれこそ、ちょっと大げさなような……。", "zh": "咦？这……\n你这么说，才真的是有点太夸张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "0647ff3a0bbc0c06172485a9cca2c024cc0f8a296c432a2b8ad3ab5f800b40fe", "ja": "でも、本心なんですもの……。それとも、\nこんな大げさなことを言う子は……イヤですか？", "zh": "不过，我是发自内心这么想的……还是说，\n你不喜欢……讲话这么夸张的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a22a9e75d1b45a7fbb461903c5ab538b18e651ee13a5d971d785c7688c13b8c0", "ja": "歌織さん……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_1017", "source_sha256": "48ef2b674823d03d45863e46e4706682f9588ef1d13921134ae3a8508483ffb5", "ja": "いいえ", "zh": "不会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d839910146f4106c73cd461d690da34d71e4f9e5768f8b81906519b06e1721bb", "ja": "イヤじゃないです。アイドルのプロデューサーの\n人生は、ずっと歌と共にありますから。", "zh": "不会不喜欢啊，毕竟偶像制作人的人生，\n永远都是与歌曲同在的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2001_p", "source_sha256": "b9aa379a84991d2e5df87bcfdefd05530ae3fc42712fc91c1fdeb66a07dfc808", "ja": "歌織さんがこれから、\nずっと歌と共に旅をするのなら……。", "zh": "既然歌织小姐今后要\n永远和歌曲一同旅行的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2002_052kao", "source_sha256": "1d535a6c57002e97b7b346979f38d43b5bad85c15fd1a53da1fa79b0157825b1", "ja": "あっ。ずっと……。", "zh": "啊！永远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2003_p", "source_sha256": "5720eac136a34cdbc05aad50b22ee81067066ee7ff8999f957be72b3e16050f4", "ja": "はい。これからも、一緒に旅を続けましょう。\nいつか歌織さんが「もうイヤです」っていう日まで。", "zh": "是啊，今后也一起旅行下去吧。\n直到歌织小姐觉得厌烦了的那一天为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2004_052kao", "source_sha256": "80a3fac3f09f47b066dfb411a35dff3a35b41057aaaed8e13df1d3960d045e8f", "ja": "まあ。……ふふっ、わかりました。\nただ、そういうお話だとすると……。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵，我知道了。\n只是，这么一来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_044_2005_052kao", "source_sha256": "cbccc67ed07c2ccd894ae484fe5a345983d954ab6b53e5c9d70706309b5c64da", "ja": "ずっとご一緒させていただく、っていうことに\nなると思いますけれど♪", "zh": "我觉得会变成「我们永远在一起」就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
